  "description": {
    "en": "The Dunlop CX 400 TOUR 2024 is a versatile control-oriented performance racquet featuring a 100 sq.in head, 300 g unstrung weight and 320 mm slightly head-light balance. It blends control, power, comfort and stability in a more forgiving package than the smaller-headed CX 200 models. SONIC CORE with Infinergy improves rebound and vibration absorption, VIBROSHIELD enhances comfort and feel, POWERGRID STRINGTECH+ supports spin and power, while CONTROL FRAME GEOMETRY improves stability and swing-through.",

    "zh": "Dunlop CX 400 TOUR 2024 是一款兼顾控制、力量与舒适性的高性能球拍，采用100平方英寸拍面、300克空拍重量及320毫米略偏头轻平衡设计。相比拍面更小的 CX 200 系列，它拥有更好的容错率与更容易获得的力量，同时仍保持 CX 系列强调的精准控制与稳定性。SONIC CORE with Infinergy 提升回弹与减震表现，VIBROSHIELD 改善舒适性与手感，POWERGRID STRINGTECH+ 增强旋转与力量，而 CONTROL FRAME GEOMETRY 则进一步提升拍框稳定性与挥拍效率。"
  },

